        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "每組產出 2",
          "x": 1285,
          "y": 620,
          "size": 39,
          "at": 6,
          "color": "ink",
          "font": "cute",
          "anim": "write",
          "jitter": 0
        }
      ],
      "hold": 1.3,
      "center": false,
      "min_dur": 0
    },
    {
      "narration": "氫氣足量時，零點六零零莫耳氮氣完全反應，生成幾莫耳氨？請把已知的氮氣放在換算因子分母。",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "text": "0.600 mol氮氣會產多少氨",
          "x": 170,
          "y": 145,
          "size": 86,
          "font": "marker",
          "anim": "write",
          "at": 0.15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step1",
          "text": "0.600 mol N₂",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 330,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step2",
          "text": "× (2 mol NH₃/1 mol N₂)",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 453,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        }
      ],
      "hold": 4,
      "center": false,
      "min_dur": 0
    },
    {
      "narration": "零點六乘二，得到一點二零莫耳氨。同時需要一點八零莫耳氫氣。題目必須給氫氣足量，才可以把全部氮氣都當成已反應。",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "text": "答案：1.20 mol氨",
          "x": 170,
          "y": 145,
          "size": 86,
          "font": "marker",
          "anim": "write",
          "at": 0.15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step1",
          "text": "NH₃：0.600×2＝1.20 mol",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 330,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step2",
          "text": "H₂需求：0.600×3＝1.80 mol",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 453,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        }
      ],
      "hold": 1.3,
      "center": false,
      "min_dur": 0
    },
    {
      "narration": "兩莫耳氯酸鉀分解，得到三莫耳氧氣。二點五零莫耳氯酸鉀，先乘三除二，再乘氧氣莫耳質量三十二，得到一百二十公克。寫科學記號讓三位有效數字清楚。",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "text": "再把莫耳換成產物質量",
          "x": 170,
          "y": 145,
          "size": 86,
          "font": "marker",
          "anim": "write",
          "at": 0.15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step1",
          "text": "2KClO₃ → 2KCl＋3O₂",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 330,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step2",
          "text": "2.50×3/2＝3.75 mol O₂",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 453,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step3",
          "text": "3.75×32.00＝1.20×10² g",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 576,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        }
      ],
      "hold": 1.3,
      "center": false,
      "min_dur": 0
    },
    {
      "narration": "已知氨的質量時，要反推反應需要的氫氣質量，能不能直接照反應式乘三除二？請指出少了哪一步。",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "text": "氨17.0 g，能直接乘2嗎",
          "x": 170,
          "y": 145,
          "size": 86,
          "font": "marker",
          "anim": "write",
          "at": 0.15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step1",
          "text": "g NH₃ → ? → mol H₂ → g H₂",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 330,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step2",
          "text": "反應式的3:2是什麼比例？",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 453,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        }
      ],
      "hold": 4,
      "center": false,
      "min_dur": 0
    },
    {
      "narration": "先用氨的莫耳質量除，換成莫耳氨；再乘三比二，得到莫耳氫氣；最後乘氫氣莫耳質量。每一步都要保留物質名稱，只有相同物質的單位才能消去。",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "text": "把兩座質量橋補齊",
          "x": 170,
          "y": 145,
          "size": 86,
          "font": "marker",
          "anim": "write",
          "at": 0.15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step1",
          "text": "g NH₃ ÷ M(NH₃)",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 330,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step2",
          "text": "×(3 mol H₂/2 mol NH₃)",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 453,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step3",
          "text": "× M(H₂) → g H₂",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 576,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        }
      ],
      "hold": 1.3,
      "center": false,
      "min_dur": 0
    }
  ]
